@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
hide empty description

[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Opening : open event
Stopped --> Closing : close event
Stopped --> Open : only open limit
Stopped --> Closed : only close limit
Closed --> Opening : open event
Open --> Closing : close event
Opening --> Open : open limit seen
Closing --> Closed : close limit seen
Opening --> WaitClose : close event
Closing --> WaitOpen : open event
WaitOpen --> Opening : 2 s elapsed
WaitClose --> Closing : 2 s elapsed
WaitOpen --> WaitClose : close event
WaitClose --> WaitOpen : open event
WaitOpen --> Open : open limit seen
WaitClose --> Closed : close limit seen
SensorConflict --> Open : only open limit
SensorConflict --> Closed : only close limit
SensorConflict --> Stopped : no limit

state Opening : open contactor ON
state Closing : close contactor ON

note as N
Checked first, from every state:
1. permission or position unavailable -> Stopped
2. both limits true -> SensorConflict
3. STOP/overload lost or both
   requests pressed -> Stopped
   (not from SensorConflict)
end note
@enduml
